<title>USA: Rohm/Haas says Q4 comparison less favorable.</title>
<headline>Rohm/Haas says Q4 comparison less favorable.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA, Pa. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rohm and Haas Co said on Wednesday its polymers, resins and monomers segment reported the greatest increase in earnings, but that overall comparisons in the fourth quarter wouldn not be as favorable.</p>
<p>The company, which reported third quarter 1996 earnings of $1.31 per share against $0.85 per share in the same quarter last year, said it had posted very strong results in the fourth quarter 1995.</p>
</text>
